      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="links mono"><a href={`${base}/research/preprint.pdf`}>preprint (PDF)</a><a href={`${base}/research/pilot.pdf`}>pilot (PDF)</a></p>
    <h3 class="h3">Who could help</h3>
    <p class="sub">Groups whose published methods or theories bear directly on this, named from their published work, with the
      places their latest PubMed records give. None has been approached, and none is involved in or has endorsed this project; they
      are where a lab, a co-author or a check would most naturally come from.</p>
